Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 13:36:25 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] J714s developer image: the internal display through the DCP
 at full panel height, GPU-rendered desktop

m1n1-aurora 1.6.1.aurora22.j714s5 hands the DCP over by default and keeps the
notch rows (betizzel/omarchy-m5 m1n1 0006-0007); linux-aurora
7.3.0.aurora16.j714s3-6 gives the boot loaders the DCP device tree;
omarchy-aurora-firmware 20261014.j714s5 sets up the two-card Hyprland
session; hyprland-m5 0.57.2-2 (a new support package filling the hyprland
role) is Omarchy's Hyprland with the M5 DCP patches. The runtime installs
hyprland-m5 as a target, so stock hyprland never installs. All from
betizzel/omarchy-m5 (650b22d1).
